19, 2026</p></div></div></a><a href="/blog/tiktok-trends-case-study"><div class="megaMenuColumnItem"><div class="megaMenuColumnItemInfo"><p class="megaMenuColumnItemLabel">How Two Entrepreneurs Used TikTok and Trends to Create a Viral Launch</p><p class="megaMenuColumnItemDescription">March 11, 2026</p></div></div></a></div><div class="megaMenuColumnActions"><a href="/case-studies">All Case Studies</a></div></div><div class="megaMenuInnerColumn megaMenuCtaColumn megaMenuCtaColumnTrending"><div class="megaMenuColumnCtaInner"><p class="megaMenuColumnCtaTitle">See what&#x27;s trending before everyone else</p><p class="megaMenuColumnCtaInfo">Each week, we&#x27;ll send you our best Exploding Topics. Plus, expert insight and analysis.</p><div class="megaMenuColumnActions megaMenuNewsletterForm"><form method="post" class="newsletter_form" accept-charset="UTF-8" action="/api/newsletter-subscribe-check"><div style="display:none"><input type="hidden" name="meta_web_form_id" value="1686512983"/><input type="hidden" name="meta_split_id" value=""/><input type="hidden" name="listname" value="awlist6179910"/><input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://explodingtopics.com/thank-you" id="redirect_f38062f7a899c56a95439214c21cdd76"/><input type="hidden" name="meta_redirect_onlist" value="https://explodingtopics.com/already-subscribed"/><input type="hidden" name="meta_adtracking" value="Exploding_Topics_list"/><input type="hidden" name="meta_tags" value="exploding-topics-list"/><input type="hidden" name="meta_required" value="email"/><input type="hidden" name="meta_tooltip" value=""/></div><div id="af-form-1686512983" class="af-form"><div id="af-header-1686512983" class="af-header"></div><div id="af-body-1686512983"><div class="newsletter_form_inner"><input type="email" value="" class="text form-control newsletter_field" id="awf_field-113227448" name="email" tabindex="501" placeholder="Email address"/><button name="submit" class="submit btn newsletterButton" type="submit" tabindex="502">Signup<span><svg width="5" height="8" viewBox="0 0 5 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M0.584961 0.5C0.602081 0.500008 0.609061 0.50296 0.611328 0.503906C0.613714 0.504905 0.622763 0.508505 0.637695 0.523438L3.93359 3.81934C3.94945 3.83519 3.95601 3.84528 3.95801 3.84863C3.95908 3.85121 3.96094 3.85667 3.96094 3.86816L3.95801 3.88672C3.95619 3.88982 3.94977 3.89983 3.93359 3.91602L0.621094 7.22852C0.61326 7.23635 0.607345 7.24122 0.604492 7.24316C0.603175 7.24405 0.601973 7.24393 0.601562 7.24414H0.594727C0.576457 7.24347 0.561556 7.24124 0.532227 7.21191C0.518236 7.1979 0.513966 7.18944 0.512695 7.18652C0.511771 7.18431 0.508789 7.1765 0.508789 7.15918C0.508823 7.1421 0.511777 7.13501 0.512695 7.13281C0.513809 7.13019 0.517649 7.12102 0.532227 7.10645L3.41797 4.22168L3.77148 3.86816L0.515625 0.612305C0.507791 0.60447 0.503893 0.598556 0.501953 0.595703L0.5 0.592773C0.499899 0.591445 0.499885 0.589089 0.5 0.585938C0.500678 0.567693 0.502929 0.552735 0.532227 0.523438C0.547139 0.508533 0.55621 0.504904 0.558594 0.503906C0.56099 0.502915 0.568087 0.5 0.584961 0.5Z" fill="white" stroke="white"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div><div class="alertWarning"></div></form></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="landingHero"><div class="landingHeroWrapper"><picture><source srcSet="/static/images/home-page/background-1440w.webp" media="(min-width: 1440px)"/><source srcSet="/static/images/home-page/background-1200w.webp" media="(min-width: 1200px)"/><source srcSet="/static/images/home-page/background-992w.webp" media="(min-width: 992px)"/><source srcSet="/static/images/home-page/background-768w.webp" media="(min-width: 768px)"/><source srcSet="/static/images/home-page/background-576w.webp" media="(min-width: 576px)"/><source srcSet="/static/images/home-page/background-360w.webp" media="(min-width: 360px)"/><img src="/static/images/home-page/background-1440w.webp" alt="Hero image" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"/></picture><div class="container featureContainer"><div class="featureContainer__column"><h1>Put Trend Discovery on Autopilot with Exploding Topics Integrations</h1><p>Connect Exploding Topics to Zapier or n8n to build workflows that automate trend discovery and analyzing. Save hours of manual work.</p><a href="/pricing">Start Free Trial</a></div><div class="featureContainer__column"><img src="https://cdn.buttercms.com/kB24VdvtTre24e9FWTPD" alt="Feature graphic"/></div></div></div></section><section class="methodology_trend_insights"><h5 class="methodology_trend_clustering_title capitalize">Your Workflow, Automated</h5><p class="methodology_trend_clustering_title_text">Stop copying and pasting trends into spreadsheets. Connect Exploding Topics to your existing tools and let automations do the heavy lifting.</p><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-1 order-md-1 order-1 no_right_padding"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.buttercms.com/output=f:webp/qqbmmxt8RyuAZuHMchxg" alt="Automate Everyday Trend Spotting Tasks with Zapier graphic" class="featureBorderImage"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-2 order-md-2 order-2"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_text"><h6 class="capitalize">Automate Everyday Trend Spotting Tasks with Zapier</h6><p>No coding required. Connect Exploding Topics to the apps you already use — Google Sheets, Notion, Slack, and more — and set up automations that run on a schedule so trend data is always where you need it, when you need it.</p></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-4 order-md-4 order-3 no_left_padding"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.buttercms.com/output=f:webp/qqbmmxt8RyuAZuHMchxg" alt="6 Different Zapier Event Types to Personalize Your Data Feeds graphic" class="featureBorderImage"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-3 order-md-3 order-4"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_text"><h6 class="capitalize">6 Different Zapier Event Types to Personalize Your Data Feeds</h6><p>Choose from six action event types — Get Trending Topics, Get Products, Get Startups, Get Meta Trends, Get Topic Details, and Search Topic Database — to trigger automations in any connected app. Collect trends by keyword, flag topics that meet your criteria, or generate content briefs automatically.</p></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-5 order-md-5 order-5 no_right_padding"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.buttercms.com/output=f:webp/c8RMUsBgQIWNWILwGhOY" alt="Build AI Agents That Think and Act on Trends with n8n graphic" class="featureBorderImage"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-6 order-md-6 order-6"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_text"><h6 class="capitalize">Build AI Agents That Think and Act on Trends with n8n</h6><p>For more complex workflows, use the Exploding Topics API in a n8n HTTP Request node to build AI agents that go beyond simple automations. Cross-reference trend data with other sources, pull in LLMs, and include human review checkpoints — all in one workflow.</p></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-8 order-md-8 order-7 no_left_padding"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.buttercms.com/output=f:webp/c8RMUsBgQIWNWILwGhOY" alt="Automate the Analysis, Not Just the Data Collection graphic" class="featureBorderImage"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-7 order-md-7 order-8"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_text"><h6 class="capitalize">Automate the Analysis, Not Just the Data Collection</h6><p>Use n8n to build agents that identify content gaps for trending topics, generate SEO briefs, source leads from trending startups, validate trends against your team&#x27;s submissions, or assess competitive gaps in your product category. An AI chat builder is available to help you get started, even if you&#x27;re not a developer.</p></div></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-9 order-md-9 order-9 no_right_padding"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.buttercms.com/output=f:webp/dzNRIOT1KkbLa6kF38Gw" alt="The Exploding Topics API: The Engine Behind It All graphic" class="featureBorderImage"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 order-lg-10 order-md-10 order-10"><div class="methodology_trend_categorization_text"><h6 class="capitalize">The Exploding Topics API: The Engine Behind It All</h6><p>Both integrations run on the Exploding Topics API. And if you want to go further, it&#x27;s available for custom builds, too. Developers can use the API to create their own trend tracking and analysis tools, tailored exactly to how their business operates.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="brandsSection featureTemplateBrandSection"><div class="container"><div class="row align-items-center"><div class="col-md-5 brandsHeading featureTemplateBrandSectionHeading"><h3>Exploding Topics Pro is trusted by <span>1,200+</span> teams worldwide.</h3></div><div class="col-md-7 brandsLogos"><div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center"><div class="col-auto"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="80" height="26" viewBox="0 0 80 26" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_983_3539)"><path d="M34.7735 13.683C34.7735 17.4233 31.8458 20.1783 28.2547 20.1783C24.6636 20.1783 21.7358 17.4233 21.7358 13.683C21.7358 9.91765 24.6636 7.18774 28.2547 7.18774C31.8478 7.18774 34.7735 9.91765 34.7735 13.683ZM31.9211 13.683C31.9211 11.3464 30.2239 9.74612 28.2567 9.74612C26.2875 9.74612 24.5924 11.3443 24.5924 13.683C24.5924 15.9967 26.2896 17.62 28.2567 17.62C30.2239 17.62 31.9211 15.9946 31.9211 13.683Z" fill="#A0A2AF"